  "description": "Opt-in server-side diagnostics. Set MYKO_WS_DIAGNOSTICS=1. Fingerprint-based unchanged counts are diagnostic only; successful sends do not prove Unreal application. Periodic logs are disabled unless separately enabled. See the accompanying runbook for limits and metric translation."
